        "status": "answer",
        "answer": "The following table shows the total market value of Technology sector holdings and their percentage of the total portfolio value for each portfolio:\n\n| Portfolio Name | Technology Sector Value | Percentage of Portfolio |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| Growth Equity Fund | 1,866,148.00 | 84.67% |\n| Conservative Income Fund | 0.00 | 0.00% |\n| Tech Innovation Fund | 1,565,292.50 | 100.00% |\n| Balanced Portfolio | 388,704.00 | 36.22% |\n| ESG Sustainable Fund | 272,978.00 | 27.10% |\n| Small Cap Value Fund | 0.00 | 0.00% |\n| International Equity Fund | 346,888.00 | 47.20% |\n| Fixed Income Plus | 0.00 | 0.00% |\n| Dividend Aristocrats Fund | 0.00 | 0.00% |\n| Emerging Markets Fund | 339,095.00 | 32.45% |\n| Total Stock Market Index Fund | 3,093,520.00 | 46.71% |\n| Total Bond Market Index Fund | 0.00 | 0.00% |\n| Total International Index Fund | 1,427,086.00 | 62.55% |",
        "tools": [
          {
            "tool": "sql_query",
